n-place softmax error: {e}')\n\\\"\n\"","aggregated_output":"Current p1: 4.503 ms\nVariant 2 (explicit): 3.538 ms, ratio: 1.272\n\nSoftmax on C-contiguous: 2.628 ms\nSoftmax on transposed: 2.618 ms\nSoftmax on dim=1: 2.781 ms\n\nHas softmax_: False\nIn-place softmax error: 'Tensor' object has no attribute 'softmax_'\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
